    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1993 a levee breach flooded Hardin and its cemetery, sweeping away 793 burials.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        13,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hardin%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After the flood, 645 remains were recovered, but only 120 were identified and reburied with original headstones.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hardin%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A memorial was added to the cemetery’s western entrance in 1994 to honor the 1993 flood and the unidentified bodies.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
